  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "ん？\r\nはーい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0113",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "こんにちは～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "はづき先生！\r\nいらっしゃい、どうかされましたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "いいえ～\r\nちょっと遊びに来ちゃいました～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "あっ……もうお昼休みの時間だったんですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふふ、\r\nお仕事に集中していたんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "いえいえ……\r\n今日もカウンセラー室は閑古鳥が鳴いてまして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "そうなんですね～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "いや、かと言って\r\n流行ってほしいわけではないんですけれどもね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "生徒たちに悩み事が無いから暇──\r\nそういうことなら、その方がいい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "でも必要な時にはちゃんと頼ってもらえるように、\r\n少しずつ、生徒たちと仲良くできたらなって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "そんなことをぼーっと考えていたら……\r\nはは……お昼になっていました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふふ……\r\n先生はお優しいんですね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "いえいえ、ただ不器用なだけで……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……大丈夫ですよ、きっと\r\n焦らずゆっくりやっていきましょう～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110070"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "私、美味しいお茶を持ってきたんです～\r\n少しお湯をいただいてもいいですか？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "あっ、すみません、お構いもしないで……\r\n俺が淹れますので座っていてください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "いいえ、先生にはこれから\r\n頑張ってもらわないといけないんですから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "今日くらいは、\r\n私に労わせてください～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "……そうですか\r\nじゃあ、今日ははづき先生にお願いしようかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、お任せください～♪",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101111/4901011110110"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011110120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ちなみに、先生はお好きなお茶とかありますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024",
